# Severance Priest: the token is X/X with X the mana value of the exiled card. Bot1 exiles Mox Jet (mana value 0), so when Bot2
# bolts the Priest Bot2 creates a 0/0 Spirit, which is put into the graveyard by a state-based action (CR 704.5f) and ceases to exist:
# no Spirit is left on Bot2's battlefield, and Mox Jet stays exiled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Severance Priest
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Lightning Bolt
Island x4
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Severance Priest.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Mox Jet)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Exile = Mox Jet
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Severance Priest)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Severance Priest
Exile = Mox Jet
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Ruby
